# Pin line endings for text sources so byte-probes (and git diff) stop lying
# about LF/CRLF churn (audit 2026-10-01, extra). Normalization applies on
# checkin; working-tree files are NOT renormalized in place without an
# explicit `git add --renormalize` (deliberately NOT run — staging policy).
*.R        text eol=lf
*.Rd       text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.md       text eol=lf
renv.lock  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf
